            "review_title": "Review at TIF Garden",
            "review_text": "Amia B\n4 contributions\n0\nSeafood and beer kind of evening\nOct 2026 • Friends\nThis turned out to be exactly the place we needed after a long day. We ordered several seafood dishes, shared everything and had some draft beer. The food was delicious and the atmosphere was lively without being too noisy. A very enjoyable evening.\nWritten October 8, 2026\nTIF Garden\nDear Amia,\n\nThank you for spending your evening at TIF GARDEN and for sharing such a lovely review. We’re delighted that our seafood dishes and draft beer were just what you and your friends needed after a long day.\n\nIt’s especially wonderful to hear that you enjoyed the lively yet comfortable atmosphere. We hope to welcome you back soon for another relaxing evening filled with good food, cold beer, and great company.\n\nWarm regards,\nTIF GARDEN Team\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
