            "review_title": "Review at TIF Garden",
            "review_text": "Jordan Spencer\n4 contributions\n0\nLovely evening with the family\nOct 2026 • Family\nWe brought our family here for dinner and had a really nice time. The garden setting made it feel comfortable and informal, and the menu offered something for everyone. The staff were patient and friendly, and the food came out at a good pace.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 5, 2026\nTIF Garden\nDear Jordan,\nThank you for choosing TIF GARDEN for your family dinner. We’re delighted that our garden setting created a comfortable and relaxed atmosphere for everyone.\nIt’s wonderful to hear that your family found something to enjoy on the menu and that our team was patient, friendly, and attentive throughout your visit. We also appreciate your kind comment about the pace of service.\nWe look forward to welcoming you and your family back for another lovely evening together.\nWarm regards,\nTIF GARDEN Team\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
