            "review_title": "Review at TIF Garden",
            "review_text": "Dalrymple Clanton\n3 contributions\n0\nGood choice for visitors to Saigon\nOct 2026 • Friends\nIf you're staying around central Saigon, TIF Garden is worth considering. The location is convenient, but once you're inside, it feels surprisingly peaceful. We enjoyed a relaxed dinner with good food and attentive service. It was one of the nicer meals we had during our stay.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 4, 2026\nTIF Garden\nDear Dalrymple,\nThank you for recommending TIF GARDEN to visitors exploring Saigon. We’re delighted that our central location was convenient while the atmosphere inside offered a peaceful and relaxing escape from the city.\nIt means a great deal to know that you enjoyed the food and attentive service, and that your dinner with us was among the nicer meals of your stay. We hope to welcome you and your friends back whenever you return to Saigon.\nWarm regards,\nTIF GARDEN Team\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
