            "review_title": "Review at TIF Garden",
            "review_text": "Ciela C\n6 contributions\n0\nSimple, enjoyable dinner\nOct 2026 • Couples\nNothing complicated, just good food, cold beer and a nice atmosphere. We ordered seafood and a few Vietnamese dishes to share, and everything arrived fresh and tasty. The staff were friendly and the service was efficient. Exactly what we were looking for that night.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 1, 2026\nTIF Garden\nDear Ciela,\nThank you for sharing your experience at TIF GARDEN. We’re so pleased that you enjoyed a relaxed evening with fresh seafood, Vietnamese dishes, and cold beer.\nYour kind comments about our friendly team and efficient service mean a lot to us. Sometimes a simple dinner with good food and the right atmosphere is exactly what makes an evening memorable. We hope to welcome you both back again soon.\nWarm regards,\nTIF GARDEN Team\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
