            "review_text": "Alayna A\n2 contributions\n0\nA pleasant surprise in District 1\nOct 2026 • Friends\nI walked past TIF Garden Saigon before but never realized how nice it was inside. The garden restaurant has a really pleasant atmosphere, especially in the evening. Food was delicious and portions were enough for sharing. Definitely somewhere I would return to.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 1, 2026\nTIF Garden\nDear Alayna,\nThank you for discovering the garden inside TIF GARDEN and sharing your lovely experience. We’re delighted that the evening atmosphere was such a pleasant surprise and that you enjoyed the food with your friends.\nIt’s also wonderful to hear that the portions were well suited for sharing, as TIF GARDEN is designed to bring people together around the table. We truly appreciate your intention to return and look forward to welcoming you back soon.\nWarm regards,\nTIF GARDEN Team\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
